WEBVTT

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.350
Huh?

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.820
Huh... Huh?

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:34.800
What's that?

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.060
Huh?

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.210
Oh, no!

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:51.170
Monsters! A great Monster army is coming!

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:58.820
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:02.790
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:05.290
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:09.800
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:15.600
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:19.540
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:27.650
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:34.950
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:40.500
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:47.630
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:53.110
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:55.540
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:01:55.540 --> 00:02:02.480
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:04.750
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:08.820
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.330
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:15.860
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:21.670
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:24.570
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:40.950
Double Strafing!

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:48.260
Heal!

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:55.200
Bitch!

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:00.240
Lai!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.830
Double Attack!

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.320
Sonic...

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:14.510
...Blow!

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.560
Are you all right, Iruga?!

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.540
Holy Light!

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:38.110
Lai!

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:39.340
Tis!

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:44.710
Me, too!

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:48.980
Blitz Beat!

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.670
Good, Falco!

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:03.570
They're still coming!

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:06.340
There'll be no end to this!

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:07.600
Him...

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:18.150
We've got to destroy him...

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:19.020
Iruga!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:21.460
Yuufa! Use "Heal"!

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:22.820
Heal!

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:26.360
No!

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:37.010
Take care of Tis!

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.310
What?

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:39.330
Lai!

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:50.250
Osiris!!

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:58.690
Lai!

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:02.230
S-Sorry, Tis. This is all my fault...

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.700
No, it's all right.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:07.700
...As long as I can die with you.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.100
Tis!

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:14.380
This is depressing!
Don't talk about dying!

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.380
B-But...

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:16.940
Big Brother Iruga...

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.000
They're coming!

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:46.630
Frost... Diver!

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.010
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:00.720
Is everyone all right?

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:05.590
Thunder... Storm!

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:14.740
Rescuer Ma-<i>chan</i> at your service!

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:17.540
Ready? Here goes! There!

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.030
Poring!

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:27.680
Holy Light!

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:36.960
--Dad!
--Chief! I'm...

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:41.860
We'll talk later! First we're going to send Osiris back to sleep!

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:43.100
--Right!

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.970
Accelerated-speed Blessing!

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:59.110
Oh, oh, oh, oh!

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:02.750
Do something, quick!
Don't you have herbs or something?!

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.390
Let's see...

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:05.590
Here!

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:07.860
This is free of charge, I hope?

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:08.990
Sure.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.260
Good! Help me, then.

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:32.810
No good! They're breaking in!!

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:34.720
Get more men!

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.950
Everybody who's free defend here!

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.540
D-Dammit!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:59.870
They've broken in!

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:21.600
What should we do, Glaris?

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:22.930
This way.

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:36.040
Oh, my. Oh, my. Dear, Dear.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.200
Hurry!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:47.350
This is Morok calling.
Reporting a state of emergency.

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:04.030
Th-This is terrible! An emergency!

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:12.210
Midgard Broadcasting Station reporting.

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:15.450
This is an emergency bulletin.

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:17.890
A state of emergency has arisen!

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:21.910
The town of Morok is being attacked by Monsters!

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:25.490
The town of Morok?!

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.560
If we can stop Osiris...

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:37.810
Chief!

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:38.930
Dad!

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.240
Who are you?!

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.920
B-Big Brother!!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:52.520
Is that your greatest effort in desperation?

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:56.060
In this world, only the strongest will survive.

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:59.030
The weak have no value in living.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:02.060
They are unworthy even of having hopes.

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:04.800
Their very existence is useless.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:06.600
--B-Big Brother!
--Yuufa!

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:14.840
Do you wish for your brother?

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:17.780
Then reveal your heart.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:23.220
If your wish should be granted,
I shall be your brother.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:27.720
Now, come to me.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:31.460
Yuufa...

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:34.020
Now, come to me, Yuufa.

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:36.190
B-Big Brother...

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:56.480
Open your eyes, Yuufa!

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:02.090
My friend Keough would never say anything to mislead you!

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:04.790
Then who am I?!

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:34.780
<i>Big Brother...</i>
<i>Big Brother tried to kill me...</i>

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:44.470
I-It's hopeless...

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:45.990
You mustn't give up!

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:55.330
Heal!

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:58.780
You dirty...

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:02.750
Quagmire!

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.620
Sonic Blow!

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.160
Awesome!

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:28.270
Big Brother Iruga!

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:42.950
Frost Diver!

00:12:46.560 --> 00:12:47.630
Drink this.

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:49.160
Hang on!

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.500
Are you okay?

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:53.470
I'm running out of recovery items.

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:54.700
Poring...

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:02.680
Hey, wait!

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:04.150
Where're you going?!

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:06.150
Wait a minute!

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:08.480
It's dangerous! Go back.

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:14.690
Forget it! How are you going to put us in danger again?

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:19.390
It's my job to see that you don't betray us again.

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:22.060
Hey, wait a minute, I said!

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:36.000
This place should do...

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.740
What are you going to do, anyway?

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.650
Cold Bolt!

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:46.020
Why're you doing such a stupid thing?

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:51.430
Cold Bolt!

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:54.190
Cold Bolt!

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:01.730
Iruga!

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:09.010
It's over.

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:17.650
W-Wait!!

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:18.720
Iruga!

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.490
After him!

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:21.550
--Yes, sir!

00:14:23.390 --> 00:14:26.420
Cold Bolt!

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:34.240
What's the sense in doing that?

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:38.370
Thunder... Storm!

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:48.920
You?

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:51.610
It wasn't for you that I did it, especially...

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:01.730
Who are you?!

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:06.420
So you're Zephyrus's pawn?

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.200
Holy Light!

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:16.180
What's wrong, Yuufa?

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:19.950
I thought I was your brother.

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:22.180
You're not my brother!

00:15:22.180 --> 00:15:27.620
My brother would never try to kill me or hurt anyone!

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:30.520
That's right! You're not Keough!

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:41.040
Yes, that's right.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:45.570
You're the ones who hoped that I was Keough.

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:50.440
So you went and believed it and disappointed your own selves.

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:53.980
But true despair is not like this.

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:56.380
I'll show you...

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:58.380
true despair!!

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:03.890
Lightning...

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:05.360
Bolt!

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:16.200
What?! What happened?!

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.120
A hole in the wall!

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:32.310
Light of the Sun, lead King Osiris to the nether world!

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:37.690
The sun isn't up, yet!

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:38.780
Impossible!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:45.500
Too bad. Your intent was probably to use the sunlight

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:49.240
to make King Osiris and the undead vanish.

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:52.070
But you were just a little too early.

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:57.670
Even nature is on our side.
It seems your luck has run out.

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:05.820
B-Big... Big Brother Keough!

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:07.450
It can't be...

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:10.060
Roan!

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:13.030
I'm disappointed in you.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:17.660
I was wrong to place my dear sister in your care!

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:25.740
Yuufa, my beloved little sister, in this world, all is only despair!

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:29.910
I shall send you to heaven before this world turns into hell.

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:32.910
It is your only salvation.

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:36.710
How could you? Big Brother... why?

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:40.210
Big Brother!

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.590
Come!

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:51.060
Cold Bolt!

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:57.100
You, again...

00:17:57.100 --> 00:18:01.980
You don't know your place, pawn to Zephyrus.

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:03.980
What do you mean by that?

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:06.680
How do you know my <i>sensei</i>'s name?

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:11.390
It seems you don't really know what you are.

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:12.550
What?!

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:15.560
You are no more than a pawn!

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:19.520
A throwaway pawn, who gave body and soul to "truth"!

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:23.030
A mere puppet.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:30.170
Most pleasing... that face, full of disappointment.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:33.340
Beautiful, that very face of betrayed expectations.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.000
How could that be?!

00:18:57.560 --> 00:19:01.370
It's hopeless. We kill them and kill them, but they keep coming back.

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:11.680
Dad!

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:13.110
Are you all right?!

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:18.950
Never mind me. You must destroy King Osiris somehow.

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:30.230
Nothing you do will help.
All you have left is hopelessness.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:37.070
But without <i>Sensei</i>'s instructions,
I... I can do nothing!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.470
Pull yourself together!

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:42.310
How can you give up after coming so far?!

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:44.510
Get up, Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:47.410
What is your power for?!

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.280
I'm not giving up!

00:19:49.280 --> 00:19:53.220
For the sake of my friends,
I won't give up!

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:02.830
Shine!

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:04.130
Frost!

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:05.220
Diver!

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:49.340
The Monsters are disappearing!

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:52.440
We did it! We destroyed Osiris!

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:58.540
Well, never mind.
I've accomplished my purpose.

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:01.550
Big Brother!

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:50.440
Isn't that nice? They make the perfect couple, after all.

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:52.770
It's nice that everyone blesses their marriage.

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:56.840
But he broke the Thieves' Code. Why?

00:21:56.840 --> 00:22:00.410
It's only human to forget rules and succumb to greed.

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:01.350
But...

00:22:01.350 --> 00:22:03.020
What're you talking about?

00:22:03.020 --> 00:22:07.720
You did what you wanted, too, in the fight.

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:08.960
But I was...

00:22:08.960 --> 00:22:11.360
Well, not that it matters, anyway.

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:17.430
How wonderful.
Shall we do it, too, Iruga?

00:22:17.430 --> 00:22:19.960
Then you'll be my younger sister, won't you?

00:22:27.540 --> 00:22:29.010
<i>Yuufa...</i>

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round</i> <i>that will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.940 --> 00:23:34.640
<i>Roan and the others go to</i>
<i>Assassin Guild to heal their wounds.</i>

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:37.810
<i>But the wounds of the heart</i> <i>prove difficult to heal.</i>

00:23:37.810 --> 00:23:40.180
<i>Oh, what will happen?</i>

00:23:40.180 --> 00:23:42.520
<i>Next time,</i> "I Can't Do It."

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:44.820
<i>Please patronize us again.</i>
